## Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
# The packages folder can be ignored because of Package Restore
**/[Pp]ackages/*
# except build/, which is used as an MSBuild target.
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/
# NuGet v3's project.json files produce more ignorable files
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

